                                    ------------------
                                    Neutron Web Start
                                    ------------------


Neutron Web Start

    To start Neutron application click this link {{{demo.jnlp}Java Web Start}}.

    You can Drag and Drop .jad files or http jad links to running Neutron application.

* Some example applications you can try.

*---------------------------+-----------+
| Drag and Drop .jad link   | Web Start |
*---------------------------+-----------+
| {{{http://wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jad}A Sudoku Game}}  |  <<<{{{open/wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jnlp}\u00bbOpen}}>>>
*-----------------------+-----------+
| {{{../neutron-examples/neutron-demo/neutron-demo.jad}Neutron Demo}} |  <<<{{{open-local/~/neutron-examples/neutron-demo/neutron-demo.jnlp}\u00bbOpen}}>>>
*-----------------------+-----------+
| {{{../neutron-examples/neutron-fcview/neutron-fcview.jad}Neutron JSR-75 Demo}} |  <<<{{{open-local/~/neutron-examples/neutron-fcview/neutron-fcview.jnlp}\u00bbOpen}}>>>
*-----------------------+-----------+
| {{{../neutron-tests/neutron-test-midlet/neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jad}Neutron CLDCUnit tests}} |  <<<{{{open-local/~/neutron-tests/neutron-test-midlet/neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jnlp}\u00bbOpen}}>>>
*-----------------------+-----------+
