*-----------------------+-----------+
| {{{http://www.google.com/gmm/gmm.jad?make=Generic&model=Advanced%20MIDP2&ver=v2.0.3}Google Maps Generic}}  |      <<<{{{open/www.google.com/gmm/gmm.jnlp?make=Generic&model=Advanced%20MIDP2&ver=v2.0.3}\u00bbOpen}}>>>
*-----------------------+-----------+
