* Other Neutron Web Start demonstrations

    Neutron Web Start with JSR-82 available at {{{http://bluecove.sourceforge.net/}BlueCove project website}}


* Add a link from your page to start Neutron.

    Your users can start your MIDlet application with a single click.

    URL Example:

---
For JAD URL:
    http://wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jad
Neutron Web Start URL:
    http://neutron.org/webstart/wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jnlp
---

  HTML text on your page:

---
    <a href="http://neutron.org/webstart/wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jnlp">Run it now</a>
---

  {{{http://neutron.org/webstart/wintermute.de/wap/extended/5ud0ku.jnlp}Try it yourself first}}